  "comment": {
   "comments": [
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "6089a4c12a753d0071341edb",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Jared Whiklo",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4c12a753d0071341edb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Headers from a RDFSource</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\nLink: &lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Resource&gt;;rel=<span class=\"code-quote\">\"type\"</span>\r\n</span>Link: &lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Container&gt;;rel=<span class=\"code-quote\">\"type\"</span>\r\n</span>Link: &lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/ns/ldp#BasicContainer&gt;;rel=<span class=\"code-quote\">\"type\"</span></span></pre>\n</div></div>\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>But headers for NonRDFSource</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\nLink: &lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Resource&gt;;rel=<span class=\"code-quote\">\"type\"</span>\r\n</span>Link: &lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/ns/ldp#NonRDFSource&gt;;rel=<span class=\"code-quote\">\"type\"</span></span></pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>and for a <tt>fcr:metadata</tt> endpoint</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\nLink: &lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Resource&gt;;rel=<span class=\"code-quote\">\"type\"</span>\r\n</span>Link: &lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/ns/ldp#RDFSource&gt;;rel=<span class=\"code-quote\">\"type\"</span></span></pre>\n</div></div>",
     "created": "20/Apr/18 5:05 PM",
     "id": "19901",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/12682/comment/19901",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "6089a4c12a753d0071341edb",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Jared Whiklo",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4c12a753d0071341edb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "updated": "20/Apr/18 5:05 PM"
    },
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "6089a4c12a753d0071341edb",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Jared Whiklo",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4c12a753d0071341edb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>This behaviour has been in-place since 2014.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/9b6bd6f5bbcfb045a4f7fd9a7e0536efb3bb6126#diff-d372035f89c8d0846920e20bd13e0145R436\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/9b6bd6f5bbcfb045a4f7fd9a7e0536efb3bb6126#diff-d372035f89c8d0846920e20bd13e0145R436</a></p>\n\n<p>In looking at the example requests in the W3C LDP spec I noticed that while the initial responses use</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\nLink: &lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/ns/ldp#RDFSource&gt;; rel=<span class=\"code-quote\">\"type\"</span>,\r\n</span>&lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Resource&gt;; rel=<span class=\"code-quote\">\"type\"</span></span>\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>once they start to implement a DirectContainer the response headers change to</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\nLink: &lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/ns/ldp#DirectContainer&gt;; rel=<span class=\"code-quote\">\"type\"</span>,\r\n</span>&lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Resource&gt;; rel=<span class=\"code-quote\">\"type\"</span></span></pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>Replacing the RDFSource with the explicit container definition. I am guessing this is why <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5fca8a549592df00764ce49c\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"5fca8a549592df00764ce49c\" data-account-id=\"5fca8a549592df00764ce49c\" accountid=\"5fca8a549592df00764ce49c\" rel=\"noreferrer\">cb</a> did it this way originally.</p>",
     "created": "23/Apr/18 10:37 AM",
